  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  pairs:
  - key: {fileID: 0}
    terminal: {fileID: 2496847089996223963}
    keyText: "Este chip de memoria puede ser reparado para recuperar informaci\xF3n
      del pasado, tambi\xE9n otorga acceso al arsenal de mascaras de asalto"
    openText: Mascara activada; Portal desplegado al siguiente objetivo
    keyGoal: 
    openGoal: 
    onOpen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  - key: {fileID: 0}
    terminal: {fileID: 6465863649496133535}
    keyText: "Esta m\xE1scara permite desplegar operaciones de rescate o combate
      escaramuza. adem\xE1s confiere autoridad para activacion de la siguiente mascara"
    openText: El desnivel es una muestra del poder nuclear que acabo con la humanidad.
      El siguiente objetivo esta al NorOeste del laboratorio central
    keyGoal: 
    openGoal: 
    onOpen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  - key: {fileID: 0}
    terminal: {fileID: 6844252082636635836}
    keyText: "Esta m\xE1scara otorga potencia de ataque, me servira para abrirme
      paso hasta el laboratorio de los embriones"
    openText: el sentido de nuestra mision, eclosionar los embriones en la incubadora;
      El nuevo portal se ha desplegado muy cerca de aqui hacia el nuevo objetivo
    keyGoal: 
    openGoal: 
    onOpen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  - key: {fileID: 0}
    terminal: {fileID: 3397205306740791840}
    keyText: El futuro de la raza humana depende de estos embriones, Debo Llevarlos
      a salvo para que la incubadora active el crecimiento
    openText: Fallo el sistema de regriferacion! solo restan 2 hembriones, debo apresurarme
      a buscar el combustible necesario para encencer la nave!; Para encontrarlo
      debo alcanzar el portal que acaba de activarse muy cerca de aqui
    keyGoal: 
    openGoal: 
    onOpen:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls:
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
        - m_Target: {fileID: 0}
          m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.GameObject, UnityEngine
          m_MethodName: SetActive
          m_Mode: 6
          m_Arguments:
            m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
            m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
            m_IntArgument: 0
            m_FloatArgument: 0
            m_StringArgument: 
            m_BoolArgument: 1
          m_CallState: 2
  - key: {fileID: 0}
    terminal: {fileID: 5080521635334719010}
    keyText: "Este cargamento deber\xEDa ser suficiente para la producir ignicion
      de los motores. La Nave se Encuentra NorEste desde el laboratorio Central"
    openText: Preparandose para el despegue
    keyGoal: 
    openGoal: 
